abstract: >-
  Public MIT-licensed sovereign engine: a FastAPI application with a
  Port-380 MCP gate, an append-only hash-chained YAML ledger (ledger/ and
  ledger.v2/) sealed with SHA3-256, a ledger verifier run in CI, and
  Argo CD / Argo Rollouts manifests for Gateway API canary delivery.
